From c0e4d556244915b4ef6a0ab4f4dc06a39cda6ac3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mat Kowalski <mko@redhat.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Jul 2026 13:10:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 15/26] MCO: source frr-peers.json from installer
 bgp-vip-config ConfigMap

Bootstrap: RenderBootstrap reads the bgp-vip-config ConfigMap manifest
from the asset dir (new optional --bgp-vip-config-file flag) and exposes
config.json via ControllerConfigSpec.BGPVIPPeersJSON.
Day-2: the operator reads the same ConfigMap from
openshift-network-operator (new Role/RoleBinding) on each sync.
The frr-peers.json bootstrap tmpl and day-2 MachineConfig templates now
render the real JSON instead of referencing a nonexistent field.
Also guards the operator-side singular VIP helpers against empty VIP
lists, mirroring the template-controller fix.
